        "original_id": "e0134a2b-0334-5645-ab9c-f9e574228e98",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ali Zafar, Syed Mohammad Ahmed, Osama bin Laden\n- Works: Tere Bin Laden\n- Roles: young reporter, dialogue writer\n- Awards: Lux Style Awards, Filmfare Award nomination\n- Topics: migration to the United States, fake video sold to TV channels\n\nFacts:\n- Tere Bin Laden stars Pakistani pop singer Ali Zafar in the lead role as an ambitious young reporter.\n- In Tere Bin Laden, Ali Zafar's character desperately wants to migrate to the United States.\n- In Tere Bin Laden, Ali Zafar's character makes a fake Osama bin Laden video using a look-alike and sells it to TV channels.\n- Syed Mohammad Ahmed wrote dialogue for the Indian movie Tere Bin Laden.\n- Ali Zafar has received five Lux Style Awards.\n- Ali Zafar has also received a Filmfare Award nomination.",
